<title>USA: Clinton to make statement on Jereusalem attack.</title>
<headline>Clinton to make statement on Jereusalem attack.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>President on Clinton was to make a statement on the bombing attack in Jerusalem on Wednesday at 9:30 AM EDT (1330 GMT), the White House said.</p>
<p>White House spokesman Joe Lockhart said Clinton would go before cameras and microphones in the White House press room to condemn the attacj, which killed at least 18 people and injured more than 150.</p>
